-- Form 1 = the skeletal ribcage Susanoo: spine, 6 pairs of ribs, sternum,
-- collarbones, skeletal arms and a BIG skeletal hand (every finger bone).
--
-- Two layers:
--   * SKIN  - a detailed glowing model (~150 parts), visible only to YOU
--             (client-side parts). Outlined so you can see it through walls.
--   * TOYS  - your 20 spawned toys follow the skeleton (spine, ribs, sternum,
--             shoulders, arm, hand + fingertips), so other players see them.
--
-- Big right hand: Slam + gestures (thumbs up, point, middle finger, peace).
-- Hotkeys (PC): Q = slam, Z = thumbs up, X = point, C = middle, V = peace

